  "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-01.html": {
   "file": "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-01.html",
   "quest": 10285,
   "text": "Kegor: Again, thank you! Without you, we'd be in deeper trouble and I may very well have died. You are quite skilled... thank the Gods you are on our side! However, as skilled as you are, it isn't enough. In order to stop Freya, we'll need something of immense power that can absorb her power, such …",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 1; switch(st.getMemoStateEx(1)) case 1"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Are you okay now?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10285_MeetingSirra 32761-02.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10285_MeetingSirra",
     "event": "32761-02.html",
     "quest": 10285,
     "to": "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-02.html",
     "effect": "cond:4"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-03.html": {
   "file": "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-03.html",
   "quest": 10285,
   "text": "Kegor: You don't have to worry about me. Can you go over the details with Jinia? That's all I can tell you for now.",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 1; switch(st.getMemoStateEx(1)) case 2"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-04.html": {
   "file": "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-04.html",
   "quest": 10285,
   "text": "Kegor: I don't like it either...but we could use Sirra's power to help us. Just listen to Sirra's story first.",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 1; switch(st.getMemoStateEx(1)) case 3"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-01.html": {
   "file": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-01.html",
   "quest": 10287,
   "text": "Kegor: She hated Felicia and killed her, thus becoming the Ice Queen Freya. She couldn't escape her destiny. But really, which of us ever could?",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 1; memoStateEx1 == 1; memoStateEx2 == 0"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Keep telling the story.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft 32761-02.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft",
     "event": "32761-02.html",
     "quest": 10287,
     "to": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-02.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-04.html": {
   "file": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-04.html",
   "quest": 10287,
   "text": "Kegor: Jinia wants to tell you something. Come back after you talk to her.",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 1; !((memoStateEx1 == 1) && (memoStateEx2 == 0)); memoStateEx1 == 0; memoStateEx2 == 0"
