   "links": []
  },
  "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-02.html": {
   "file": "Q10285_MeetingSirra/32761-02.html",
   "quest": 10285,
   "text": "Kegor: Don't worry about me, I'll be all right. But you'll want to talk to Jinia. I have nothing more to say until you do.",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "4"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-02.html": {
   "file": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-02.html",
   "quest": 10287,
   "text": "Kegor: In the end, even Sirra won't be able to free herself from Freya's shadow. She will be a worse Ice Queen than Freya, if such a thing is possible! No one close to her will ever dare betray her... She learned her lesson well. She makes people fear her until she knows she can trust them. Atrocio…",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Wrap up the story.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft 32761-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft",
     "event": "32761-03.html",
     "quest": 10287,
     "to": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-03.html",
     "effect": "cond:4"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-03.html": {
   "file": "Q10287_StoryOfThoseLeft/32761-03.html",
   "quest": 10287,
   "text": "Kegor: I understand. I have so much to thank you for, I hardly know where to begin... Jinia and I want to show our gratitude. Before you leave, talk to Jinia.",
   "header": "Kegor",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "4"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
